[{"source" ":org/Math-Academy" "forms" [{:db/id 17592186129177 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-f74663e2-eda6-5c43-8b1e-ec79f6eff3d7"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-f74663e2-eda6-5c43-8b1e-ec79f6eff3d7" :question/id #uuid "f74663e2-eda6-5c43-8b1e-ec79f6eff3d7" :question/math-academy-id "q-129445" :question/problem "Find the equation of the tangent plane to the surface $z={x}^{3}{y}^{2}-2$ at the point $(1,2,2).$" :question/worked-solution "The Cartesian equation of the tangent plane to the surface $z=f(x,y)$ at the point $({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})$ on the surface can be written as\n\n$$\nz-{z}_{0}=(x-{x}_{0})\\frac{∂f}{∂x}({x}_{0},{y}_{0})+(y-{y}_{0})\\frac{∂f}{∂y}({x}_{0},{y}_{0}).\n$$\n\nFirst, we find the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({x}^{3}{y}^{2}-2) \\\\  & =3{x}^{2}{y}^{2} \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}({x}^{3}{y}^{2}-2) \\\\  & =2{x}^{3}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we evaluate the partial derivatives at $(x,y)=(1,2):$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x}(1,2) & =3({1}^{2})({2}^{2})=12 \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂y}(1,2) & =2({1}^{3})(2)=4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we write down the equation of the tangent plane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z-2 & =(x-1)\\frac{∂f}{∂x}(1,2)+(y-2)\\frac{∂f}{∂y}(1,2) \\\\ z-2 & =12(x-1)+4(y-2) \\\\ z-2 & =12x+4y-20 \\\\ 12x+4y-z-18 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-4e280a27-9de7-5a03-bfcc-a35615144270"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-4e280a27-9de7-5a03-bfcc-a35615144270" :answer-field/id #uuid "4e280a27-9de7-5a03-bfcc-a35615144270" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-0ab27aa7-e26f-5b28-a61b-7d75dd7e76a0" :answer-field/choices ["answer-0ab27aa7-e26f-5b28-a61b-7d75dd7e76a0" "answer-50e0bc24-5e3a-552f-97d8-44ee57ea98a0" "answer-7a0a3654-4f3f-52be-a0f9-b305d2f93119" "answer-c4d8dbf8-7fb7-5f92-a1ba-286efca1292a" "answer-ec6a76ae-df6b-5fc7-8f39-9ed699a44710"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0ab27aa7-e26f-5b28-a61b-7d75dd7e76a0" :answer/id #uuid "0ab27aa7-e26f-5b28-a61b-7d75dd7e76a0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12x+4y-z-18=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-50e0bc24-5e3a-552f-97d8-44ee57ea98a0" :answer/id #uuid "50e0bc24-5e3a-552f-97d8-44ee57ea98a0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12x-4y+z-6=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7a0a3654-4f3f-52be-a0f9-b305d2f93119" :answer/id #uuid "7a0a3654-4f3f-52be-a0f9-b305d2f93119" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6x+2y+z-12=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c4d8dbf8-7fb7-5f92-a1ba-286efca1292a" :answer/id #uuid "c4d8dbf8-7fb7-5f92-a1ba-286efca1292a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6x-4y+z=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ec6a76ae-df6b-5fc7-8f39-9ed699a44710" :answer/id #uuid "ec6a76ae-df6b-5fc7-8f39-9ed699a44710" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8x-y+z-8=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186129613 :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186129180 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-6f62591f-ce02-5d1d-a041-40b4fa4f0093"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-6f62591f-ce02-5d1d-a041-40b4fa4f0093" :question/id #uuid "6f62591f-ce02-5d1d-a041-40b4fa4f0093" :question/math-academy-id "q-129487" :question/problem "Find the equation of the tangent hyperplane to the hypersurface $w={x}^{2}-{y}^{2}+{z}^{2}$ at the point $(1,0,2,5).$" :question/worked-solution "The Cartesian equation of the tangent plane to the hypersurface $w=f(x,y,z)$ at the point $({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0},{w}_{0})$ on the hypersurface can be written as\n\n$$\nw-{w}_{0}=(x-{x}_{0})\\frac{∂f}{∂x}({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})+(y-{y}_{0})\\frac{∂f}{∂y}({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})+(z-{z}_{0})\\frac{∂f}{∂z}({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0}).\n$$\n\nFirst, we find the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({x}^{2}-{y}^{2}+{z}^{2})=2x \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}({x}^{2}-{y}^{2}+{z}^{2})=-2y \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂z} & =\\frac{∂}{∂z}({x}^{2}-{y}^{2}+{z}^{2})=2z\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we evaluate the partial derivatives at $(x,y,z)=(1,0,2):$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x}(1,0,2) & =2(1)=2 \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂y}(1,0,2) & =-2(0)=0 \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂z}(1,0,2) & =2(2)=4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we write down the equation of the tangent hyperplane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}w-5 & =(x-1)\\frac{∂f}{∂x}(1,0,2)+(y-0)\\frac{∂f}{∂y}(1,0,2)+(z-2)\\frac{∂f}{∂z}(1,0,2) \\\\ w-5 & =2(x-1)+0y+4(z-2) \\\\ w-5 & =2x+4z-10 \\\\ 2x+4z-w-5 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-d53eb4df-306d-5fe9-a04a-ef268bb57a12"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-d53eb4df-306d-5fe9-a04a-ef268bb57a12" :answer-field/id #uuid "d53eb4df-306d-5fe9-a04a-ef268bb57a12" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-0d46eb51-fbd4-5527-a391-ea1f1472e1f5" :answer-field/choices ["answer-0d46eb51-fbd4-5527-a391-ea1f1472e1f5" "answer-65d02bda-6ee0-5093-a005-04eff527cec0" "answer-07f2d355-8b47-5410-897b-016de7e6340d" "answer-6ca0d6d0-706e-5535-9a5c-90b235616840" "answer-e6c72a8e-2ca4-5b18-9f33-e6a6209fea4f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0d46eb51-fbd4-5527-a391-ea1f1472e1f5" :answer/id #uuid "0d46eb51-fbd4-5527-a391-ea1f1472e1f5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2x+4z-w-5=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-65d02bda-6ee0-5093-a005-04eff527cec0" :answer/id #uuid "65d02bda-6ee0-5093-a005-04eff527cec0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3z-w-1=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-07f2d355-8b47-5410-897b-016de7e6340d" :answer/id #uuid "07f2d355-8b47-5410-897b-016de7e6340d" :answer/type :answe